{
  "name": "B2B Company to Domain, LinkedIn, Email & WhatsApp Lead Enrichment Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## B2B Lead Enrichment & Tiered Sales Routing Pipeline (3-in-1 Pure HTTP)\n\nReads raw company names, domains, or work emails from **Google Sheets**, resolves verified official domains, LinkedIn company URLs, role emails, WhatsApp links, phones, and social profiles in one Apify call, separates unresolved rows (`$0` cost) into an audit tab, scores enriched leads (`HOT`, `WARM`, `RESEARCH`), writes enriched rows to Google Sheets, and routes `HOT` leads to Slack `#sales-hot-leads` + Gmail while sending `WARM`/`RESEARCH` leads to `#sales-pipeline`.\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/b2b-company-domain-linkedin-enricher\n**GitHub MCP & Kit:** https://github.com/wonderpick/apify-b2b-ecom-automation-kit\n**Cost:** $2.50 / 1,000 enriched companies · **$0 for unresolved/parked domains** · 128–256 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview & Cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Lead List Input (Google Sheets -> Deduplicated Batch)\n\nCreate a Google Sheet with three tabs:\n- **`Input`**: column `company` (or `domain` / `email`, e.g. `Stripe`, `Linear`, `canva.com`).\n- **`Enriched`**: columns `input`, `leadTier`, `confidence`, `domain`, `websiteUrl`, `pageTitle`, `linkedinUrl`, `primaryEmail`, `primaryWhatsapp`, `primaryPhone`, `xUrl`, `githubUrl`, `enrichedAt`.\n- **`Unresolved`**: columns `input`, `inputType`, `status`, `enrichedAt`.\n\nAttach your Google Sheets OAuth credential to all three Google Sheets nodes.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 1. Lead List Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. 3-in-1 Enricher & Enriched vs Unresolved Split\n\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com) and copy your API token (`Settings -> API & Integrations`).\n2. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>`) and select it on **Enrich Companies via Apify**.\n3. Unresolved rows (`not_found`, `invalid_input`, `$0` billed) route cleanly to the `Unresolved` audit tab.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 2. 3-in-1 Enricher & Split",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Lead Tiering, Sheet Sync & Sales Routing\n\n- **All enriched leads** are appended to the `Enriched` tab in Google Sheets.\n- **HOT** (`confidence === 'high'` + LinkedIn + direct email/WhatsApp) -> Slack `#sales-hot-leads` + Gmail AE notification.\n- **WARM** & **RESEARCH** -> Slack `#sales-pipeline`.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 3. Lead Tiering & Sales Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Daily Morning Enrichment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
